    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000rhpx](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000rhpx) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 63.703 depth occurred on Oct 17 2025 136km E of Petropavlovsk-Kamchatsky. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 53.181 longitude 159.8579. It impacted 90 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
